OL,3,GNEWSAWatch the moment bridge hit at
OL,4,Aleast 45 times is driven into again
OL,5,
OL,6,FSwansea council said it was
OL,7,Fdisappointing and the warning system
OL,8,Fwas functioning normally. It urged
OL,9,Fdelivery companies to remind drivers of
OL,10,Fthe restrictions.
